<title>CHINA: C.Lyonnais finalises Hutchison warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais finalises Hutchison warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has finalised terms of the issue of 43 million American style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd, which the issuer has announced earlier on Monday.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$65	  PREMIUM	  18.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$1.183     GEARING	  5.49x</p>
<p> MATURITY	   10.MAY.98    PAYMENT DATE   21.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG    LISTING DATE   23.JUL.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$65	  BOARD LOT	10,000</p>
<p> NOTE		 CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT THE</p>
<p>			DISCRETION OF THE ISSUER.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
